sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant M as Core::Main
    participant SP as Spring<br/>AnnotationConfigApplicationContext
    participant MC as Core::ModuleConfig
    participant SL as Common::ServiceLocator
    participant JL as JPMS<br/>ModuleFinder / ModuleLayer
    participant G as Core::Game
    participant P as Plugins<br/>IGamePluginService
    participant W as Common::World

    U->>M: mvn exec:exec --non-recursive
    M->>SP: new AnnotationConfigApplicationContext(ModuleConfig.class)
    SP->>MC: instantiate @Configuration
    MC->>SL: locateAll(IGamePluginService.class)
    SL->>JL: ModuleFinder.of("plugins")
    JL-->>SL: 5 ModuleReferences
    SL->>JL: boot().configuration().resolve(finder, of(), names)
    JL-->>SL: Configuration
    SL->>JL: defineModulesWithOneLoader(cfg, systemClassLoader)
    JL-->>SL: child ModuleLayer
    SL->>SL: ServiceLoader.load(layer, service)
    SL-->>MC: List of IGamePluginService
    MC->>SL: locateAll(IEntityProcessingService.class)
    SL-->>MC: List of IEntityProcessingService
    MC->>SL: locateAll(IPostEntityProcessingService.class)
    SL-->>MC: List of IPostEntityProcessingService
    MC->>G: new Game(plugins, processors, postProcessors, scoreClient)
    Note over MC,G: ComponentRegistry groups the instances by package
    SP-->>M: Game bean
    M->>G: start(Stage)
    loop for each discovered plugin
        G->>P: start(gameData, world)
        P->>W: addEntity(...)
    end
    M->>G: render()
    Note over G: AnimationTimer begins the frame loop
